@title: Numbers must agree
STEP 1: Near twins
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/numbers.html
    CLICK the 'Page 3' link
    VERIFY that 'opened page 3' is present
    CLICK the 'Page 23' link
    VERIFY that 'opened page 23' is present
    CLICK the 'Watch in 4K' button
    VERIFY that 'picked 4K' is present
DONE.
